id: detect/frame
name: Frame margins found on the bordered test picture
prose: |
  brim detect on a JPEG with a thin even frame answers the four margin depths in pixels (top bottom left right); the band knob caps the search depth and shallower bands cut the answer down, the threshold knob steers how much disorder still counts as even.
scope:
- src/**
- Cargo.toml
- Cargo.lock
- build
- materials/bordered.jpg
covers:
- R1
- R4
rows:
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --band 0.01
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      2 2 2 2
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --band 0.05
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --band 0.5
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --threshold 0.7
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --threshold 0.9
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      62 62 62 62
